    {
      "text": "Forest plot of sensitivity and specificity with 95% confidence intervals for 6 studies of LC-aNAATs for pulmonary TB in HIV-negative people (2 Truenat MTB Plus, 4 Xpert Ultra). Sensitivities range from 0.88 to 0.97 and specificities from 0.91 to 0.99.",
